      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is how I use the nameplates too. I like turning them on to see whose around within a crowd of 30-40 people. I just need a name and yellow text to tell me if I've added them in the past like we currently have it. I hope our current plates can remain accessible going forward.",
